@startuml

title Fluxo MQTT do Sistema IoT

participant "Sensor IoT" as Sensor
participant "EMQX Broker" as Broker
participant "Consumer" as Consumer

Sensor -> Broker: CONNECT
Broker --> Sensor: CONNACK

Consumer -> Broker: CONNECT
Broker --> Consumer: CONNACK

Consumer -> Broker: SUBSCRIBE\niot/temperature/+
Broker --> Consumer: SUBACK

loop A cada 2 segundos

    Sensor -> Sensor: Gerar temperatura aleatória

    Sensor -> Broker: PUBLISH\nJSON de temperatura

    Broker -> Consumer: PUBLISH\nEvento MQTT

    Consumer -> Consumer: Processar evento

end

@enduml

@startuml

title Publicação MQTT com QoS 1

participant Publisher
participant Broker
participant Consumer

Publisher -> Broker: PUBLISH (QoS 1)
Broker --> Publisher: PUBACK

Broker -> Consumer: PUBLISH (QoS 1)
Consumer --> Broker: PUBACK

@enduml
